{"term":{"label":"愛","occurrences":6,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"6A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i","title":"告子上","description":"告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"兼","id":"兼"},{"form":"受","id":"受"},{"form":"失","id":"失"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"弟","id":"弟"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"敬","id":"敬"},{"form":"死","id":"死"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"苟","id":"苟"},{"form":"身","id":"身"},{"form":"鄉","id":"郷"},{"form":"養","id":"養"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.07312226482896259,"source":"養","target":"人"},{"weight":2.629487878599108,"source":"養","target":"苟"},{"weight":1.425515074273172,"source":"養","target":"失"},{"weight":1.530875589930998,"source":"養","target":"知"},{"weight":2.341805806147327,"source":"養","target":"兼"},{"weight":1.425515074273172,"source":"養","target":"愛"},{"weight":1.6486586255873816,"source":"養","target":"小"},{"weight":0.36080433728074357,"source":"人","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.42979720876769495,"source":"人","target":"郷"},{"weight":0.17848278048678903,"source":"人","target":"苟"},{"weight":0.5839478885949534,"source":"人","target":"兼"},{"weight":0.29626581614317243,"source":"人","target":"小"},{"weight":2.629487878599108,"source":"苟","target":"失"},{"weight":1.4457177815906914,"source":"郷","target":"敬"},{"weight":1.1944033533097853,"source":"郷","target":"知"},{"weight":2.880802306880014,"source":"郷","target":"受"},{"weight":2.4107986776342782,"source":"郷","target":"死"},{"weight":2.6984807500860595,"source":"郷","target":"身"},{"weight":3.728100167267218,"source":"兼","target":"愛"},{"weight":2.8526314299133175,"source":"兼","target":"身"},{"weight":1.754019141245208,"source":"至","target":"身"},{"weight":2.747270914255491,"source":"死","target":"受"},{"weight":2.5649493574615367,"source"